      "text": "```\nPeptidoglycan synthesis:\n  Cytoplasm: MurA-G enzymes → UDP-MurNAc-pentapeptide (ending D-Ala-D-Ala)\n  Membrane: lipid carrier → flipped to periplasm\n  Cell wall: transglycosylase (polymerizes) + transpeptidase (cross-links)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:01-antibiotics, git-history:medicine:01-antibiotics]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "current_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:antibiotics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "β-lactam ring: structural analog of D-Ala-D-Ala terminus\n  → Covalently binds PBP (penicillin-binding protein = transpeptidase)\n  → Irreversible inhibition → ↓ cross-linking → weakened peptidoglycan\n  → Autolysis (cellular hydrolases activated) → bactericidal"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:01-antibiotics, git-history:medicine:01-antibiotics]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "current_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:antibiotics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Time-dependent killing: efficacy depends on time above MIC (T>MIC)\n  Optimal when drug concentration > MIC for 40–70% of dosing interval\n  → Frequent dosing or extended infusions (β-lactam continuous infusion for resistant organisms)\n```"
    },
