        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CARBAPENEMS: imipenem, meropenem, ertapenem, doripenem\n  Broadest β-lactam coverage: gram+/−/anaerobes; ESBL coverage\n  Imipenem + cilastatin (dehydropeptidase inhibitor to prevent renal inactivation)\n  Ertapenem: no anti-pseudomonal activity (unlike the rest)\n  Resistance: carbapenemases (KPC, NDM, VIM, OXA-48) — critical ESKAPE issue"
    },
