        "root_concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nMechanisms:\n1. β-lactamase production (most common):\n   Penicillinase: hydrolyzes penicillins (Staph)\n   ESBL (extended-spectrum β-lactamase): gen 1–4 cephalosporins + penicillins; TEM/SHV/CTX-M\n     → Treat with carbapenems or ceftolozane-tazo/ceftazidime-avibactam\n   AmpC: inducible; Enterobacter/Citrobacter/Serratia (HECK YEA organisms — those on \"SPACE\")\n   Carbapenemases: KPC (serine β-lactamase), NDM/VIM (metallo-β-lactamase), OXA-48\n     → Often pan-resistant; ceftazidime-avibactam (not NDM), cefiderocol"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md#019",
      "path": [
        "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:01-antibiotics, git-history:medicine:01-antibiotics]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "current_path": "medicine/01-ANTIBIOTICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:antibiotics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. Altered PBPs (MRSA — mecA gene → PBP2a; low affinity for all β-lactams)\n3. Porins: ↓ influx (Pseudomonas OprD loss → imipenem resistance)\n4. Efflux pumps: MexAB-OprM, MexXY, etc. (Pseudomonas)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md#020",
      "path": [
        "01-ANTIBIOTICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:01-antibiotics, git-history:medicine:01-antibiotics]",
