        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antibiotics]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Antibiotics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "β-lactamase inhibitors (BLIs):\n  Clavulanic acid: suicide substrate; paired with amoxicillin (Augmentin) or ticarcillin\n  Sulbactam: piperacillin not needed; paired with ampicillin; also direct Acinetobacter activity\n  Tazobactam: paired with piperacillin\n  Avibactam: non-β-lactam BLI; active vs KPC/OXA-48 but NOT NDM\n  Relebactam: paired with imipenem/cilastatin (Recarbrio)\n  Vaborbactam: paired with meropenem (Vabomere); KPC active\n```"
    },
